# Archenemy's Charm, third mode: "Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature you control. It gains lifelink until end of
# turn." Bot2's Ornithopter is refused (not "you control"); Bot1's own Ornithopter, cast on turn 1, is the positive control.
# It becomes a 2/4 with lifelink (CR 702.15) and attacks on turn 3: Bot2 takes 2 and Bot1 gains 2 (22). On turn 5 the
# counters remain but lifelink is gone (CR 514.2, "until end of turn"), so the second attack leaves Bot1's life at 22
# and Bot2's at 16.

